{
  "name": "Basilik Telegram - Sub: Menu",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "workflowInputs": {
          "values": [
            {
              "name": "language"
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      "id": "e3ae3119-3654-44be-b3c5-c761d9ed5a9a",
      "name": "When Executed by Agent",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.executeWorkflowTrigger",
      "typeVersion": 1.1,
      "position": [32, 464]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "operation": "get",
        "dataTableId": {
          "__rl": true,
          "value": "key_value",
          "mode": "name"
        },
        "matchType": "allConditions",
        "filters": {
          "conditions": [
            {
              "keyName": "key",
              "keyValue": "portal_api_base_url"
            }
          ]
        },
        "limit": 1
      },
      "id": "e95086ac-b847-427d-ab0c-ee6023916384",
      "name": "Get Portal API URL",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.dataTable",
      "typeVersion": 1.1,
      "position": [240, 464],
      "alwaysOutputData": true,
      "onError": "continueRegularOutput",
      "notes": "Читает value из Data Table key_value по key = portal_api_base_url."
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "assignments": {
          "assignments": [
            {
              "id": "b10000-0000-4000-8000-000000000100",
              "name": "portal_api_base_url",
              "value": "={{ typeof $json.value === 'string' ? $json.value.replace(/\\/+$/, '') : '' }}",
              "type": "string"
            },
            {
              "id": "b10000-0000-4000-8000-000000000101",
              "name": "language",
              "value": "={{ ['de','ru','en'].includes($('When Executed by Agent').first().json.language) ? $('When Executed by Agent').first().json.language : 'de' }}",
              "type": "string"
            }
          ]
        },
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "b9279164-6e86-4b88-9fb8-5e5a55e4fd07",
      "name": "Config",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.set",
      "typeVersion": 3.4,
      "position": [464, 464],
      "notes": "Нормализует URL из Data Table и язык из входа. Ресторан портал берёт из PORTAL_RESTAURANT_SLUG."
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "method": "POST",
        "url": "={{ $json.portal_api_base_url + '/api/integrations/n8n/menu' }}",
        "authentication": "genericCredentialType",
        "genericAuthType": "httpHeaderAuth",
        "sendBody": true,
        "specifyBody": "json",
        "jsonBody": "={{ JSON.stringify({ language: $json.language }) }}",
        "options": {
          "timeout": 10000
        }
      },
      "id": "630cb742-59b3-4d9b-8bc8-b1c08fdb4a9b",
      "name": "Get Current Menu",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest",
      "typeVersion": 4.2,
      "position": [688, 464],
      "credentials": {
        "httpHeaderAuth": {
          "id": "gqRw7NDurfwDUOGU",
          "name": "hello-table"
        }
      },
      "onError": "continueRegularOutput",
      "notes": "Выберите HTTP Header Auth credential: Authorization = Bearer <PORTAL_N8N_API_KEY>."
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "jsCode": "// Portal API уже вернул типизированный tool envelope. Здесь только fallback\n// для сетевой ошибки HTTP Request, которую n8n пропустил в regular output.\nconst result = $input.first().json;\nif (result?.ok === true || (result?.ok === false && typeof result.error === 'string')) {\n  return [{ json: result }];\n}\nreturn [{ json: { ok: false, error: 'unreachable' } }];"
      },
      "id": "a8bf50c1-0b30-42c7-983d-7d8f278e73eb",
      "name": "Format Response",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.code",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [912, 464]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Получение меню через Portal API\n\n**Вход:** `language` (`de`, `ru` или `en`).\n\n1. `Get Portal API URL` читает `value` из Data Table `key_value` по ключу `portal_api_base_url`.\n2. `Config` нормализует URL и язык.\n3. `Get Current Menu` вызывает `POST /api/integrations/n8n/menu`.\n4. `Format Response` возвращает tool envelope агенту.\n\nBearer-секрет хранится только в HTTP Header Auth credential.",
        "height": 340,
        "width": 560,
        "color": 5
      },
      "id": "179762d6-d538-4074-97da-7d6cb2dbb011",
      "name": "About this workflow",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [0, 0]
    }
  ],
